RTX Monitor setup\par\par
The monitoring service is required. The desktop app and configurator are optional and can be added or removed later.\par\par
Import the accompanying rtx5090monitor.icuewidget file manually in iCUE. The desktop app configures the backend service and does not need to remain open for monitoring.\par\par
Uninstall removes the service and installed application files. Backend configuration and per-user preferences are retained.\par\par
Third-party components retain their own licenses. See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt in the release ZIP. This page describes installation behavior; it does not replace those licenses.}
